---
description: SkatingX project-wide engineering standard
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow the repository-root AGENTS.md before planning or editing.
For auth, Firestore schema, Security Rules, migration scripts, or privacy boundaries:
1. inspect the relevant ADR and runbook;
2. list risks and rollback before changing code;
3. run all required validation before declaring completion.
Do not modify legacy Blaze Skate repositories unless the active task explicitly authorizes it.
